    rdfs:comment "The EU Declaration of Conformity for this battery, modelled as a cccev:Evidence supporting the EU Battery Regulation requirements. Carries the document URL (eubat:declarationOfConformity), the declaration ID (eubat:euDeclarationOfConformityId), and the notified body that signed off (eubat:hasNotifiedBody)."@en;
